         <div type="div1">
            <head>Five Portfolios of Colour Plates</head>
            <p rend="justify">These make good studies and are full of suggestions for everyone doing water colour work. All uniform in size. 5¼ x 9. like sample.</p>
            <p rend="justify">Each portfolio done by a different artist</p>
            <p rend="justify">Sent prepaid on receipt of price</p>
